ME_PIPE = ['<b>1. Systematic Component Library Scoring (`ecggen/select.py`):</b> Evaluates 96 OTAs from `opa-gen-gemini4` using composite LNA and Auxiliary/DSL figures of merit (weighting subthreshold NEF, 1/f noise density, open-loop gain A<sub>0</sub> > 90 dB, CMRR/PSRR, and compact finger count), 25 switches from `switch-gen-gemini4` (scoring charge injection Q<sub>inj</sub>, clock feedthrough, R<sub>on</sub> flatness, and sub-pA off-leakage), and 32 comparators from `sa-gen-gemini4` (scoring delay, fJ/conv energy, and input offset σ).', '<b>2. Six Chopping + Input Impedance Boost Architectures (`ecggen/circuit.py`):</b> Synthesizes complete closed-loop SPICE netlists combining input/demodulation choppers (f<sub>chop</sub> = 4–5 kHz), Option-B MIM input/feedback capacitors (C<sub>in</sub>/C<sub>fb</sub> = 80×), positive-feedback / buffered / charge-flipping / precharge Impedance-Boosting Loops (IBL), 18 TΩ segmented PMOS pseudo-resistors or active Gm-C DC Servo Loops (f<sub>L</sub> ≈ 0.10 Hz), 1.0 kHz anti-aliasing LPF, and ADC bootstrapped S&H + clocked comparator load.', '<b>3. Compute-Farm Closed-Loop Sizing & 324-Point DSE (`ecggen/dse.py`):</b> Tunes Core LNA bias current I<sub>core</sub>, Auxiliary/DSL/PGA bias current I<sub>aux</sub>, and LPF capacitance C<sub>lpf</sub> on the compute farm so all 36 cards hit exact power targets (175 nW, 375 nW, 740 nW) and f<sub>H</sub> = 1.0 kHz.', '<b>4. Exhaustive Nominal Testbenches TB1–TB6 (`ecggen/sim.py`):</b> Evaluates (TB1) DC OP & AC transfer [1 mHz–200 kHz], (TB2) CMRR/PSRR & ±350 mV Electrode DC Offset sweep, (TB3) |Z<sub>in</sub>(f)| with IBL ON vs. OFF, (TB4) Unchopped vs. Chopped Input-Referred Noise PSD, NEF & PEF, (TB5) Coherent 50 Hz FFT THD/HD2/HD3/SFDR, THD vs. Amplitude & two-tone IMD3, and (TB6) Synthetic P-QRS-T ECG waveform driving the reused ADC S&H and clocked comparator.', '<b>5. Multi-Dimensional Variation Resilience TB7–TB8:</b> Runs (TB7) 29-corner PVT matrix (`tt`, `ss`, `ff` × −40/27/85 °C × ±10% V<sub>DD</sub> + `sf`, `fs`), (TB8-A) 30-run per-finger mismatch Monte Carlo (`sw_stat_mismatch=1`), (TB8-B) ±15% IBL capacitor variation stability sweep (proving zero over-compensation oscillation), and (TB8-C) 0–2 MΩ dry-electrode contact mismatch sweep.', '<b>6. Experimental gLayout (PR #128) + KLayout DRC/LVS (`ecggen/layout.py`, `ecggen/verify.py`):</b> Generates hierarchical macro placements of interdigitated common-centroid MOSFET rows, well-tie taprings, Option-B MIM capacitor arrays, and high-resistance poly segments routed on Metal1–Metal3. Verified with `gf180mcu.drc` (0 violations) and `gf180mcu.lvs` (`Netlists match`).', '<b>7. Magic Parasitic Extraction & Post-PEX Farm Closure (`ecggen/pex.py`):</b> Extracts distributed layout coupling/ground capacitances via Magic `ext2spice` and re-runs TB1–TB6 on the compute farm.']

