SE_LISTS = [['<b>#1 — Positive-Feedback IBL Capacitor Ratio (ΔC<sub>pf</sub> / C<sub>fb</sub>, 3σ = ±8%):</b> Because boosted input impedance scales as Z<sub>in,boost</sub> = Z<sub>in,0</sub> / (1 − β<sub>IBL</sub>) with β<sub>IBL</sub> ≈ 0.90, normalized sensitivity reaches <b>S<sup>Zin</sup><sub>Cpf</sub> = +9.8 to +11.9</b>. An uncalibrated ±8% 3σ ratio shift (MIM mismatch + parasitic routing coupling) swings |Z<sub>in</sub>(50 Hz)| by <b>±78% to ±95%</b> and risks negative-resistance oscillation if β<sub>IBL</sub> → 1.0.<br> <b>→ Calibration Cell:</b> `5-bit Switched MIM Cap Array (C_pf_cal[4:0])` (±20% range, LSB = 1.25% C<sub>pf</sub> ≈ 1.4 fF) reduces 3σ |Z<sub>in</sub>| spread from ±91% to <b>±7.3%</b>.', '<b>#2 — Core OTA Subthreshold Bias Current (ΔI<sub>bias,core</sub>, 3σ = ±24%):</b> In deep weak inversion, g<sub>m</sub> = I<sub>D</sub> / (n·U<sub>T</sub>) is strictly linear in I<sub>D</sub> (<b>S<sup>fH</sup><sub>Ibias</sub> = +0.92, S<sup>P</sup><sub>Ibias</sub> = +1.00</b>). A ±24% 3σ current reference shift moves the −3 dB anti-aliasing cutoff f<sub>H</sub> by <b>±22.1%</b>, power by <b>±24.0%</b>, and open-loop gain A<sub>OL</sub> by <b>±1.5 dB</b>.<br> <b>→ Calibration Cell:</b> `5-bit Subthreshold PTAT Current DAC (I_core_cal[4:0])` (±35% range, LSB = 2.2% ≈ 0.4 nA) locks f<sub>H</sub> within <b>±2.1%</b>.'], ['<b>#3 — Subthreshold PMOS Pseudo-Resistor (ΔV<sub>th,p,PR</sub> & Temp, 3σ = +220% / 3.2×):</b> The 4-series subthreshold PMOS pseudo-resistor channel resistance R<sub>PR</sub> ≈ 18 TΩ scales exponentially as exp(|V<sub>th,p</sub>| / nU<sub>T</sub>), shifting high-pass cutoff f<sub>L</sub> by <b>−143% (S<sup>fL</sup><sub>Rpr</sub> = −0.66)</b> across ±35 mV V<sub>th,p</sub> and temperature.<br> <b>→ Calibration Cell:</b> `4-bit Gate-Overdrive / Duty-Cycled PR Trim DAC (V_pr_cal[3:0])` (0.18×–5.5× R<sub>PR</sub>, 15 mV/step) locks f<sub>L</sub> ∈ [0.05, 0.12] Hz (<b>±15.9% residual</b>).', '<b>#4 & #5 — Global NMOS/PMOS Threshold Skew (ΔV<sub>th,n</sub> − ΔV<sub>th,p</sub>, 3σ = ±42 mV) & Thermal Excursion (ΔT = ±60 °C):</b> Skewed SF/FS corners compress cascode/inverter V<sub>DS</sub> saturation headroom in `current_reuse` and `folded_cascode_pmos` OTAs (shifting A<sub>OL</sub> by <b>−3.8 dB</b>, f<sub>H</sub> by <b>−16.7%</b>, and V<sub>out,DC</sub> by <b>±39.2 mV</b>), while thermal voltage U<sub>T</sub> = kT/q shifts g<sub>m</sub> by <b>−16.1%</b> across −40..+85 °C.<br> <b>→ Calibration Cells:</b> `4-bit PMOS Tail / CMFB Trim DAC (V_cm_cal[3:0])` (±80 mV, LSB = 10 mV) + `PTAT Bias Slope Trim (α_ptat[2:0])`.']]

